1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,200
In the Yigong Continent,

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,400
all trades prospered.

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,120
The creators on this continent were called Yanshi.

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,720
They could build bridges, pave roads,

5
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,800
construct cities, and control waters.

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,720
They could also make wooden birds fly

7
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,000
and mechanisms move on their own.

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,200
Using living souls as spirits,

9
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,160
wood as bones,

10
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,120
copper as sinews,

11
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,160
and qi as blood,

12
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,940
with the ruler as the law, this was called "Yan".

13
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,560
The Yanshi sect

14
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,160
inherited the arts of Lu Ban.

15
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,860
Over a thousand years,

16
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,290
it gradually split into two branches.

17
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,520
The Yang branch

18
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:28,560
upheld righteousness and protected life.

19
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,520
The Yin branch

20
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,600
used living beings to make puppets,

21
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,300
stealing their vitality.

22
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:34,800
Since then,

23
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,040
the Yin branch sought to seize the Yang branch's secret arts,

24
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:39,240
and the two branches fought endlessly.

25
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:01,280
Save me.

26
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:32,000
Using living people to feed mechanisms.

27
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,130
Master, be careful.

28
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:47,840
This puppet is too bizarre.

29
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:50,370
Xuanchen, take this half scroll and go first.

30
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,200
Master, I...

31
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:56,200
You go first. I'll find you after I deal with this.

32
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,960
The technique is not mature enough,

33
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,280
but it's sufficient.

34
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,000
Hand over the scroll,

35
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,970
and I'll leave your corpse intact.

36
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,720
You won't get it.

37
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:25,400
No, you can't destroy the Lu Ban Scroll.

38
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:35,560
Master!

39
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,860
After that battle,

40
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,800
the Yin branch went into hiding.

41
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:44,800
Years later, they changed their identity,

42
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,360
taking the name of the Mo family,

43
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:49,220
and became a powerful clan in the Yigong Continent.

44
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,640
Xuanchen, the second-generation successor of the Yang branch,

45
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,500
always kept a secret watch on the Mo family's plots,

46
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,690
investigating alone for decades.

47
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Time passed.

48
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:01,640
Until his old age,

49
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,220
he finally discovered

50
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:07,690
that the Mo family had secretly hidden formations in palaces everywhere.

51
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,820
I must investigate this matter personally.

52
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,440
If I really don't come back,

53
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,200
don't rush to find me.

54
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,920
Hone your skills first.

55
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:31,200
It's been ten years, Master.

56
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,920
Where are you?

57
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,140
Don't rush.

58
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,730
I'll take you out to play in a while.

59
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:57,880
Qinghe.

60
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:00,720
Something strange happened at an inn in Tongqiao Town.

61
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,800
Please go and take a look.

62
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:04,330
It might be related to your master, Xuanchen.

63
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,720
There's a clue about Master.

64
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,400
I'll go to Tongqiao tonight.

65
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,080
Who is it?

66
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,450
Don't be afraid.

67
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,560
Master Chen is already on his way.

68
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,600
Judging by the time, he should be here soon.

69
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,400
When he arrives,

70
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:38,659
we'll all feel at ease.

71
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,520
I always feel

72
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,760
that something in that beam is watching me.

73
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,800
I don't dare to sleep.

74
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,600
As soon as I close my eyes, I feel like it's going to crawl out.

75
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,060
I am here. Don't be afraid.

76
00:04:47,159 --> 00:04:48,440
When Master Chen arrives,

77
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,960
I'll guard you with him.

78
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:52,090
I won't let you be frightened anymore.

79
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:57,840
Miss.

80
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,600
There was a little incident in the shop.

81
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,800
It scared my girl.

82
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,000
I'm sorry for the embarrassment.

83
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,680
It's fine.

84
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,880
You go ahead and rest.

85
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,960
You're too polite, boss.

86
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:06,040
It's cold outside and warm inside.

87
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:06,920
I'll sit a bit longer.

88
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,180
No need to attend to me.

89
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,730
You go ahead with your work.

90
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,400
Boss Li.

91
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,600
Ten years ago,

92
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,400
this inn was renovated.

93
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:18,800
Yes.

94
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,320
The main door beam was replaced then.

95
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:23,450
Do you remember who did the carpentry?

96
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,600
A few craftsmen introduced by a friend.

97
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,320
They said the old beam was unlucky,

98
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:29,450
so I agreed to replace it with a new one.

99
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,920
The word 'robbery' pressing on the door beam

100
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:39,380
is the most vicious of the door ruler curses.

101
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,760
None of your business.

102
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:41,600
Get lost!

103
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,240
Craft of Ruin Talisman.

104
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:46,680
Seal!

105
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:54,720
Could it be

106
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:55,840
he is

107
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:57,490
a master?

108
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,840
I never offended those craftsmen.

109
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,620
Why did they harm my daughter?

110
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:03,360
They might not have been targeting you.

111
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,490
You were just implicated by this beam.

112
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:07,040
I'll take out the cursed object tonight.

113
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,080
There won't be any more trouble.

114
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,810
Where is your daughter's room?

115
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,360
The first room upstairs.

116
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:12,680
Wait a minute.

117
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,000
I'm Su Wan, a folklore student.

118
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,360
I study folk cursing customs.

119
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,320
Can I go with you?

120
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,880
Mm.

121
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,480
This is the Yanshi's wooden armor guard.

122
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,610
It can run on its own.

123
00:06:35,159 --> 00:06:36,120
It has life.

124
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:38,360
Every wooden armor guard has its own spirit core,

125
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,720
sharing the five senses with the Yanshi who created it.

126
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,880
It really understands,

127
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:43,400
and it cooperates with you on its own.

128
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,400
It's not a tool.

129
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,220
Don't scare it.

130
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,970
The cursed object is found.

131
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:03,840
Your hand.

132
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:12,960
Handled by Xuan Chen,

133
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,740
sealed in the Gengzi year.

134
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,640
Who is Xuan Chen?

135
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,000
My master.

136
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,400
Master.

137
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:27,200
The Yin and Yang lineages have always fought to the death.

138
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,360
If I really can't come back,

139
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,080
don't rush to find me.

140
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,800
Practice your skills well first.
